cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this codebook dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "LG-CISH Codebook Dataset: a 40-image augmented codebook for coverless image steganography"
abstract: >-
  A fixed codebook of 40 mutually distinct 512x512 natural images used by the
  LG-CISH coverless image-steganography framework. Pooled from the UCID, Kodak, and
  USC-SIPI benchmark suites, normalised to 512x512, embedded with CLIP ViT-B/32, and
  greedily pruned to a pairwise cosine-similarity threshold of 0.85 (base-40 coding,
  ~5.322 bits/image). Messages are encoded by the identity and order of unmodified
  images, never by pixel modification.
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-08"
license-url: "https://github.com/Circuit-Overtime/LG-CISH/blob/main/LICENSE"
url: "https://github.com/Circuit-Overtime/LG-CISH"
